cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChronoScope in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ChronoScope: A Desktop Application for Multi-Method Circadian Rhythm Analysis"
abstract: >-
  ChronoScope is a desktop application for circadian rhythm analysis that brings
  multiple established methods (CosinorPy, CircaCompare, RhythmCount, JTK_CYCLE,
  Lomb-Scargle, wavelet and spectral analysis) under a single graphical interface,
  together with CRS-AI, a random-forest consensus rhythmicity score that integrates
  the individual method outputs into a single probability.
type: software
